This patch updates the task filter functionality to properly show both active and completed tasks when the corresponding filter button is clicked. The change ensures that the filter buttons have unique IDs and that clicking them filters the task list correctly.

## Changes
- In `src/taskBoard.ts`, modified the `filterTasks` method to accept a filter type ('all', 'active', 'completed').
- Updated the render method to attach event listeners to filter buttons with IDs `filter-all`, `filter-active`, and `filter-completed`.
- The `filterTasks` method now toggles visibility based on the `completed` class.

## Diff
```diff
